WEBVTT

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.230
<i>Uki! I'm so nervous, I can't sleep!</i>

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.820
Shining! 
Cheerleading 
Competition

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.030
<i>Just thinking about the 
fact that it's tomorrow...</i>

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.820
Jeez... What am I going to do with you?

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.300
<i>Get comfy in bed and listen up.</i>

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.710
O-Okay...

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:20.510
<i>With sleep, there's REM 
sleep and NREM sleep.</i>

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:24.120
<i>REM sleep stands for 
rapid eye movement sleep,</i>

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.000
<b>Asleep Instantly</b>

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.000
<i>and NREM sleep is...</i>

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:39.010
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:01.760
<b>Episode 12:</b>

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.740
So you couldn't sleep either, Kohane-chan?

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.480
You couldn't either, Kotecchan?

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.810
Yeah, I was too excited.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.120
We're the same.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.310
Right? It's so nerve-racking, right?

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.890
The reason you can't sleep is 
because your brain is anxious.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:15.570
The day before tournaments, 
you should be resting

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.800
and achieving your best condition...

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.440
How could I, of all people,

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.320
give a lecture to break someone's 
spirit right before a tournament?!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:27.530
Don't worry. She hasn't been 
listening for a while.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:28.830
Wow, a bridge!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.840
<b>Shining! Cheerleading</b>

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:39.880
So everyone here does cheer!

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:44.280
I want to go around and hug everyone.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.390
Kohane-chan, calm down.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:51.120
Go! Don't let my sacrifice go to waste!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.140
I'm pretty sure that's called 
a perk, not a sacrifice.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.680
First we'll get signed in, then go change,

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.730
rehearse and warm up, take a photo,

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.700
and then it'll be time for our performance.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.480
We're the Kaminoki High 
School cheerleading club.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:12.590
Hello. Please turn in the CD with the song 
you'll be using during your performance.

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:13.460
Sure.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.050
Here you go...

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.960
kaminoki high school cheerleading club

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.720
Huh?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.380
What's going on right now?

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.960
It looks like an interval.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.300
The seats to the left are general admission, 
and the ones on the right are for participants.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.020
We'll be waiting for our turn over there.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.360
I'm going over to the general admission seats.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.640
Call my cell when you're about to rehearse.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.310
Okay.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:39.450
<i>We will now begin the competition 
for the middle school division.</i>

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.590
It's about to start!

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:41.650
Let's move.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.650
Middle School Division
Umenotani Middle School

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.650
<i>Entry number 1,</i>

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:48.220
<i>from Umenotani Middle School, 
the Golden Jumpers!</i>

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.910
These seats should do nicely.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.800
S-So much cheering...

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.040
It's getting exciting!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.910
Put your things under your seats.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.630
Okay!

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.310
I've been wondering since this morning... 
What's with all your stuff?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.550
I'll have you know that I only 
brought the necessities.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.180
It's starting!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.760
I'm pretty sure I just saw an 
unidentified flying object...

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.390
Huh? A UFO?

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.310
Whoa! That's amazing!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.070
M-M-M-Maybe we're not ready for this...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.590
<i>Huh? The one who's usually the noisiest 
at times like this is being quiet...</i>

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.070
<i>She can't even breathe!</i>

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:31.500
Come on, fun! Everybody say red!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.490
Red!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.400
Yellow!

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.320
Yellow!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:37.820
Everyone's cheering, even 
though they're opponents.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:43.840
Go, fight, win! Go, let's go! Let's cheer up!

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.930
Maybe they know each other?

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.310
Nope.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.840
Cheering each other on is normal.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.380
Cheering on people who 
are doing their best...

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.510
That's the principle behind cheer.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.880
That's so wonderful!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.030
Go, fight, win! Go, let's go!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.520
Let's cheer up!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.220
W-We should probably go
before you run out of stamina.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.220
You can do it! Go, fight, win!

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.520
What? Already?

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.410
Wow, it's packed.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.480
I'm glad I wore mine underneath. I just 
have to take off what I had on top.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.380
You wore it under your clothes again?!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.920
<b>Seiza Press</b>

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.580
It's finally time for me to bring this out...

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:23.120
To detract those who would defile Senpai 
with their eyes as she's trying to change...

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.420
Changing curtains!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.320
Now that I think about it, 
when I was on my last team,

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:31.120
changing curtains would magically show 
up whenever we were about to change.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.520
Does that mean...

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.020
Changing curtains don't 
just magically appear!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.190
Question these things!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.960
This isn't good...

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.700
What's wrong? Does your 
uniform not fit well?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:56.870
Am I going to be able to calmly dance 
next to Senpai when she's so perfect?

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.210
<i>Say something, Kotetsu!</i>

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.340
Incoming Call

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.960
It's no use. She's not answering.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:10.000
We'll just have to go on without her.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.150
Yeah.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.350
Oh, hey. It's the kitties.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.140
Wow, they're so good.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.150
What the heck? They definitely 
didn't get worse.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.290
W-Won't I just look like

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:26.350
a caterpillar flopping 
around out there to them?!

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.120
Uh, I wouldn't go that far...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.940
Hey, it's Arima-chan and the others!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.790
Kitties! You were super super amazing!

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:47.160
Sounds like her vocabulary died.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.340
See? We told you.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:57.510
Arima-chan and Ushiku-chan are 
both cheering with a new team.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:02.410
Wh-What should we do?

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:04.170
How should I know?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:10.200
I guess the Nekoya sisters did say that 
the rest of the team felt bad...

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.250
It's been a while.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.070
You look well.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.020
Hizume...

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.840
It's been a while.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.720
So you kept cheerleading.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.550
How's it going?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.860
We're managing.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.210
How are all of you doing?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:53.110
Both you and Ushiku-san left, 
so we struggled to fill your positions.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.860
And, of course, those two never change.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.620
It does seem that way.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:08.880
Back then, we were being obstinate...

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.680
And to be honest,

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:14.760
I kind of thought it was your fault 
that the team was falling apart...

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:23.520
But once you were gone, 
we realized for the first time

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:28.020
that you were the one raising 
the standard for us.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.940
You were the one holding us all up.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.680
Well, she is...

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.990
...the impregnable base!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.460
N-No... I mean, I...

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:47.170
was only thinking about myself, as well.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:50.080
I didn't even notice the people around me.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.650
But that's not the case now, right?

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.420
Right!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.200
Well, we'd better get going. 
Do your best out there.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.820
Thank you very much. You, too.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.320
Hopefully we can show each 
other how much we've changed.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.630
Indeed.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.080
See ya, Arima-chan.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.710
Do your best!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.830
Good luck, Arima-san.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:27.800
We'll be cheering you on.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.710
I hope you'll watch our performance.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:33.610
Thank goodness.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:34.720
Yeah.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.830
All right, time for our warm-ups.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.570
Let's give it our all, Kohane.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:41.220
Oh, y-yeah! You're right.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:49.730
<i>I have to be careful not to 
mess up and not to look down.</i>

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.130
<i>Stretch all the way down to your toes.</i>

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.740
<i>I can't mess up.</i>

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.680
<i>I'm going to do a great performance</i>

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.380
<i>so they can see that Hizume's changed.</i>

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:04.140
<i>A performance that can put Hizume's 
former teammates at ease.</i>

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.750
<i>Kohane?</i>

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:10.130
<i>Kohane-san seems different than usual...</i>

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.210
It's time.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.500
I messed up...

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.510
Don't worry. That was just the rehearsal.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:25.550
But I was so nervous. Just thinking 
about the other teams watching us...

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.160
The performance hasn't started yet.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.530
R-Right... You're right.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.180
Great job!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.120
Nekoya-san?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.150
What are you doing?

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.540
We came back!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.730
We were worried about you guys.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.070
You guys sure do whatever you want.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.990
H-How did we look?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:46.380
Well, you guys were just warming 
up, so there isn't much to say...

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.800
But we didn't really understand 
the "cheer you do with everyone"

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.720
that Arima-chan was talking about.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.010
We're going for real now.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.460
We'll look forward to 
your actual performance.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:02.570
Kaminoki High School, 
it's time for your photo.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.260
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:08.770
You in the middle, your face is too tense.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.060
Smile a little more.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:12.140
M-Me?

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:13.740
No, the one next to you.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:14.400
Huh?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:18.150
Kohane-chan isn't smiling? No way...

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.150
Her smile is the one thing 
she's got going for her.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:27.340
<i>So stiff!</i>

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.900
Um... We've got other girls waiting, so...

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.360
Oh, we're sorry!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.800
In that case...

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:42.630
Y-You look awesome, Kohane!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.040
Was that really the right way to handle that?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.760
What's with you, Kohane?!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:48.930
N-Nothing...

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.510
I'm fine!

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.810
Your expression and what you're 
saying don't match at all.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:57.270
I'm sure you'll be fine if you just 
think about cheer, Kohane-chan.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.320
Wait, is that new?

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.950
Sorry. I'll be fine.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:07.040
I'll make sure I'm smiling 
during the actual performance.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.580
You aren't all right!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.470
Huh?

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.580
You'll make sure you're smiling?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:17.460
You've always smiled like a fool by 
connecting everything to cheerleading.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.600
A fool...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:22.220
It's true, but when you 
actually say it like that...

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:27.630
If you have any worries, please tell us.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:30.220
We're a team.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.580
Worries...

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.260
Do I have any?

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.410
She's totally out of it!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.730
Well, Kohane's never looking at herself.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:41.240
You were probably thinking that you 
need to do better so that Hizume

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:44.630
can show how much she's changed, right?

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:46.700
That might be it!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.790
That's it, Uki! You get 
a hundred Kohane points!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.370
What are these mysterious points that 
I probably have around 10,000 of?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.890
I see. So that's why you were so tense.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.960
I'm sorry that I made you worry so much.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.760
No way! You don't need to apologize, Senpai!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.560
Yeah! Let's just have fun with this!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.990
This is our first tournament, after all.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.440
Yeah. If we fail to 
distinguish the difference

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:14.770
between our own abilities 
and our ideals and fail...

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:19.670
We'll regret it... forever and ever...

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.480
<i>That sounded super heavy...</i>

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:27.880
Now that you mention it, 
I think I'm a bit nervous, too.

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:33.800
Me, too, actually. I can't say 
anything about Kohane-chan.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:36.510
Everyone gets nervous 
before a performance.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.090
What? Even you, Senpai?!

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:41.240
I'm always nervous before our performances.

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.680
Would you like to see for yourself?

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.760
See for myself?! Huh?!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.510
I see that you never change, Kana-chan.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:52.280
W-Well, there's not much 
we can do at this point.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.510
We just have to do what we always do.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:59.350
As Hanawa-san says, all we need 
to do is cheer like we always do.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.360
<i>Like we always do?</i>

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:06.580
<i>How do I normally cheer?</i>

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.370
<i>Everyone's so amazing...</i>

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:26.510
<i>That performance was by the Tomosato 
High School cheerleading club.</i>

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.510
<i>Next up is entry number 16...</i>

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.510
Everyone, let's gather round.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.010
<i>The Kaminoki High School cheerleading club.</i>

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.520
This is for everyone who's 
here to cheer us on...

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.310
But most importantly,

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.010
this is the first cheer we're 
going to be doing for ourselves.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.020
<i>Kohane...</i>

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:43.550
Let's have the best time ever!

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.030
Yeah!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.150
<i>Cheer like we always do...</i>

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.160
<i>If I fail,</i>

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.620
<i>it won't be just Hizume.</i>

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.950
<i>All the effort that Uki, Kotecchan, 
and Hanawa-chan put in...</i>

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.610
<i>It'll all go to waste.</i>

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:08.590
Please start.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.360
<i>Yeah... Kohane's not her usual self.</i>

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.360
<i>Oh, no. I think I might've been late there, too.</i>

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:30.360
<i>You just have to do it like you always do!</i>

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.360
<i>Here comes the stunt.</i>

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.870
<i>Make sure our timing is together.</i>

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.310
<i>I'm going to fall!</i>

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.480
<i>Hizume, everyone...</i>

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.640
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.560
Didn't I tell you before?

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.720
Supporting you will be a breeze!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.410
Hizume!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.980
It's not just me.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.600
Kohane!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.190
Kohane-chan!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.560
Kohane!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.440
And look around you.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.490
Everyone from school is here!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.490
Kaminoki High School Basketball Team

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:21.480
Everyone's cheering us on!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.780
<i>That's right... I need to just have fun.</i>

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.340
<i>At first, I just started cheering 
because I liked it so much.</i>

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.460
<i>But now, they're all with me.</i>

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.380
<i>Everyone's supporting me.</i>

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.630
<i>...this is the first cheer we're 
going to be doing for ourselves.</i>

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.470
<i>Let's have the best time ever!</i>

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.130
<i>I just need to...</i>

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.600
<i>cheer like I always do with everyone!</i>

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.970
Kaminoki High School Cheerleading Club

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.620
Wait, we didn't even make 
it through the prelims?!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:13.480
Results

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:04.300
Don't people usually somehow make it through in situations like this?!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.190
You're dreaming, Uki.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:10.270
Half of the entrants just 
started cheerleading in April,

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.740
so this is to be expected.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.480
You're so calm...

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.790
That was so much fun.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:18.410
We saw you!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:19.480
We were watching!

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:22.970
Those were all low-level stunts, but 
you looked like you were having fun!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.420
Your arm angles and mismatched 
timing were a bit concerning,

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.660
but I could tell you were having fun!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:31.290
<i>Yeah, you could probably say 
anything to her right now...</i>

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.710
Nah, we're just kidding.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:37.170
We could definitely tell that 
Arima-chan was having fun.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:40.050
The other girls were relieved, too.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.970
Looks like the impregnable base lives on.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:46.810
I-I see... That's great to hear.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:49.320
Come on, Nekoyas, gather round.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:50.890
Oh, hey. They're calling us.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:53.440
See ya, Arima-chan and co.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.360
See you later.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.960
Yes, of course!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.880
I couldn't have asked for a better result.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.880
Yeah!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.590
Oh, there they are!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.600
Good work out there.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.050
You guys did great.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.570
Sensei! Everyone!

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.580
Arima-san!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.260
We all came to cheer you on!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.920
You were amazing, Arima-san.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.640
Thank you very much, everyone.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.480
You were great, Kana!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.420
You can do cartwheels?!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.500
You looked so cool, Kotetsu!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.900
Kon-chan!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.420
Sorry I missed your rehearsals.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:37.030
To make up for it, I'll treat you.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.620
Let's go celebrate.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:39.920
Yay!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.480
You're so generous, Sensei!

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.430
Mom! Akane!

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:47.400
Not bad, Nee-chan.

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.910
I know, right?

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:51.820
You guys came! Thanks!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:54.460
You almost fell over, Kohane.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.110
You caught me.

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:58.040
Is this your family, Uki-san?

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.050
Yeah!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.210
Maybe your brother's here, too, Hizume!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:05.200
He's not. He had kendo lessons today.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.140
Hey.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:11.020
There was some person in kendo gear 
cheering you guys on hardcore.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.700
Is he related to any of you guys?

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.560
He was getting everyone else into it.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.430
Could that be...

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:19.690
The older brother!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.700
Hours

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.880
<i>Wait, what? I mean, it's cheap, 
but they ate this much?</i>

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:31.200
<i>Young people are terrifying...</i>

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:34.810
I don't think I'll be able to 
calm down by tomorrow.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:35.460
Hey, guys...

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.790
Thanks for cheering with me.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.160
Kohane-chan...

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.840
Kohane.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.300
You're being dramatic.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:48.800
Yes. Not to mention, you started cheering

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:52.460
because you saw me cheering, so if anything...

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.730
Let's not go there.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.850
But yeah...

00:20:55.850 --> 00:21:00.860
If I didn't have you guys, I would've 
never encountered cheerleading.

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.270
Me, too.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:06.960
At first, Kohane basically 
dragged me into it, but...

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:10.120
Who knew I'd end up liking cheer so much?

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.350
Thanks, Kohane-chan.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.140
Thanks, Kohane.

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:18.500
Oh, yeah. I was asked this 
as we were leaving...

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.880
The basketball team 
has a game coming up.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:25.880
It's next week, and they'd like you 
guys to cheer for them again.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.990
Yay, a request!

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:33.640
Come to think of it, Akane has 
a soccer match coming up, too.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:37.920
There's another cheer tournament 
in the second semester, too.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.460
Wow, we're going to be really busy.

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.030
What do you think?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.600
We'd planned to take a day off tomorrow, 
but given the circumstances...

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:47.440
Yeah! Change of plans!

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:49.680
Let's start practicing again tomorrow!

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:50.780
Yeah!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.970
But I don't need to show up, right?

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:55.040
Of course you do! You're our advisor!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.040
Going out two days in a 
row is hard on my body.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:03.550
Kotecchan

00:21:58.360 --> 00:22:02.280
But you go to school every day, Sensei.

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:06.420
I'd like to try some new techniques, too.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:09.430
I want to do an even more amazing stunt next!

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.970
Everyone's jumps were amazing.

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.970
I keep telling you guys that we 
can't push ourselves too hard.

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:18.060
Don't worry. I'll support you, 
no matter what the technique is.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:19.830
Uki's also impregnable!

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:21.690
Hours

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:03.930
Kohane!

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:16.660
Cheer...

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:19.250
...is the best!

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:33.130
Go! Fight! Win!

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:42.020
Thank you for all your support!

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:42.020
Go! Fight! Win!
